The following is a list of squads for all sixteen national teams that competed at the [[Copa América Centenario]]. Each national team had to submit a squad of 23 players, three of whom had to be goalkeepers.
The provisional squads were announced on May 4, 2016.<ref>{{cite web|title=Provisional Rosters Announced for Copa America Centenario 2016|url=http://www.concacaf.com/article/provisional-rosters-announced-for-copa-america-centenario-2016|publisher=CONCACAF|access-date=4 May 2016|date=4 May 2016|archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20160610031255/http://www.concacaf.com/article/provisional-rosters-announced-for-copa-america-centenario-2016|archive-date=10 June 2016|url-status=dead}}</ref> A final selection was provided to the organizers on May 20, 2016.

