===Costa Rica===
Head coach: [[Óscar Ramírez (footballer, born 1964)|Óscar Ramírez]]

The following 23 players were called up for the final squad.<ref>{{cite web|title=¡Convocatoria #Copa100! Estos son los elegidos para integrar #LaSele que disputará la @CA2016.|url=https://twitter.com/FEDEFUTBOL_CR/status/732338691243302912|website=Twitter|publisher=FEDEFUTBOL official profile|access-date=17 May 2016}}</ref> Goalkeeper [[Esteban Alvarado]] was ruled out due to injury on May 20, being replaced by [[Leonel Moreira]].<ref>{{cite news|last1=Alfaro Rojas|first1=José Pablo|title=Esteban Alvarado queda fuera de la Copa América|url=http://www.nacion.com/deportes/seleccion-nacional/Esteban-Alvarado-queda-Copa-America_0_1561843867.html|access-date=20 May 2016|work=La Nación|date=20 May 2016}}</ref> On May 31, [[Keylor Navas]] pulled out due to a [[tendinitis]] on his left foot and was replaced by [[Danny Carvajal]],<ref>{{cite news|url=https://www.ojogo.pt/internacional/noticias/interior/keylor-navas-falha-copa-america-5202038.html|title=Keylor Navas falha Copa América|work=ojogo.pt|author=Staff|date=31 May 2016|access-date=31 May 2016}}</ref> and [[Ariel Rodríguez (footballer, born 1989)|Ariel Rodríguez]] pulled out due to injury and was replaced by [[Johnny Woodly]].

